# The public documents of the evaluation (docs/PART-B.md section 4).
# eval/get_docs.sh downloads each one into eval/docs/, checks its SHA-256 and
# converts it into eval/bundles/<name>.htpd. Questions of "test" documents are
# the test split; nothing from them is ever used for training or tuning.
#
# name          split  sha256                                                            url
riscv-debug     test   -                                                                 -
aapcs64         test   -                                                                 -
riscv-isa       train  -                                                                 -
